      title: Save
      description: 'Left-click to apply changes on the current page, local values
        will save to the local config file, server values will sync (An icon prompt
        will appear. The button turns green on successful sync, or red if it fails)

        Right-click
        to revert all changes. On exiting this page, all unsaved configs will be
        lost'
